note The base binary for the revision: the cached target/parity/bin/<commit>/codemap when a previous run already built it, otherwise a fresh target/parity/source filled from a git archive of the revision (tar -x into it), built there with cargo and CARGO_TARGET_DIR=target/parity/build, and the release binary copied into the cache.

