symbol compare
lines 0 38
hash d253555aa25d79fe
note On Linux, unless the filter is cli or starts with cli-, refuses when XDG_RUNTIME_DIR and WAYLAND_DISPLAY do not name a socket. The refusal quotes weston's fatal line about XDG_RUNTIME_DIR and names control-codemap parity. Then runs cargo test --release --test parity -- --ignored, with CODEMAP_BASE_BIN and CODEMAP_PARITY_REV set to the base binary and the parent revision (and CODEMAP_PARITY_ONLY when a scenario is named). Success reports every scenario matches. Failure reports the differing scenarios, with old.txt and new.txt kept at each path.

